Herdr Mods — Better Changes, Better Spaces, Better Tabs, and GitHub PR
Copyright 2026 Tawsif Aqib

Better Changes adapts behavior and code from Herdr Desktop's shipped Changes mod.
Herdr Desktop is available at https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app and is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Better Spaces adapts code from Herdr Desktop's shipped spaces mod.
Its bundled navigation and pull-request SVG icons are also adapted from
Herdr Desktop.

Better Tabs adapts Herdr Desktop's shipped tabs mod through the former Factory
Tabs clone. Its bundled close, spinner, file, changes, and window-control SVG
icons are adapted from Herdr Desktop as well. It adds configurable toolbar
actions, trusted local hooks, an opt-in shared button registry, and overflow.

GitHub PR extracts the pull-request integration originally developed in
herdr-workflow by Tawsif Aqib, including its native UI, GitHub CLI Go bridge,
agent actions, and tests. Its bundled UI SVG icons are adapted from Herdr
Desktop's icon set.

This distribution adds tree/flat file lists, staging controls, reusable diff
tabs, inline/split views, configurable typography, right-aligned space branches,
standalone GitHub CLI pull-request status, documentation, and tests.
